          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkidetidet e are e Nebukadnesa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olaiguanani Nebukadnesa oigeroki iltung'ana pooki, o loreren, o lng'ejepa oomanya enkop pooki: Metoponikini intae eseriani! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atoduaa nanu ajo eisidai te naitodolu ilmonek o nenking'asia naataasaka Enkai natii shumata aisul tialo nanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kebaa esapuko oo lmonek lenyena le nking'asia, kebaa enkidimata oo mbaa enyena e nking'asia! Ore enkitoria enye naa enkitoria oo ntarasi, ore enkitoo enye nebaiki iishoritin o ishoritin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nanu Nebukadnesa kaisikarra apa ti atua enkaji ai natudupe ti atua enkaji ai natudupe ti atua enkaji ai e nkitoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anoto apa nanu enkidetidet naaituria; ore airragita te ndapash naaitanyamal ndamunot o nduaat e ndukuya ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku aitanapishe nanu meyauni lelo tung'ana pooki ang'eni le Babilon meyauni dukuya nanu, pee aatum ninche aaitayiolo nanu enkibalakinoto eina kidetidet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuonu ilkuyantik o loo ntaleng'o o Lkaldayo, o laing'urak loo lakir atua ine natii; naliki nanu ninche ina kidetidet, kake maaidim ninche aatoliki nanu enkibalakinoto enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi nelotu Daniel dukuya nanu - ilo apa oji enkarna Belteshasa aaipotie enkai ai, naa atua ninye etii enkiyang'et oo nkaitin sinyat naliki nanu ninye ina kidetidet, ajoki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iyie Belteshasa, olkitok loo lkuyantik, ore enkaraki nayiolo nanu ajo etii enkiyang'et oo nkaitin sinyat atua iyie nemeetae enkisudoroto nagol te iyie, ena kidetidet nanu atoduaa; tolikioki nanu enkibalakinoto enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nena duaat e ndukuya ai ina kata airragita te ndapash naa kuna: Atoduaa nanu, naa ng'ura, olchani te mpolos e nkop; ore enkadoro enye naa eikitok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebulu ilo shani negolu ore enchumata enye nebaiki keper, naa kelioo te neiting'ie enkop pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore mbenek enyena naa eisidain naa kumok ilng'anayio lenyena, ore ilo shani netii endaa e pooki toki. Netum ing'uesi e ong'ata oloip ti abori ninye ore ntaritik o loing'ang'e nemany ilng'osil lenyena, ore pooki toki naishu neitoti te ilo shani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Atoduaa nanu te nena duaat e ndukuya ai ina kata airragita te ndapash, naa ng'ura, olarriponi, ilo osinya, nelotu adou eing'uaa shumata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyietu aishir nejo nji, ‘Entudung ilo shani meturori, nisulaa ilng'osil lenyena, nidung'oo mbenek enyena nisardakiekie ilng'anayio lenyena; nchoo ng'uesi eisik aapuo te ntonata enye neisik ntaritik too lng'osil lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake entung'uai enkobei o ntona enyena te nkop, eena te sekenkei o to suyai te mpolos oo nkujit naanana e ong'ata. Nchoo ninye eshalu te nkoliolio e shumata; nchoo erishata enye eaku te nebong'uesi ti atua nkujit e nkop; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nchoo eibelekenya endamunoto enye e tung'ani naa nchoo eishori ninye endamunoto e ng'ues naa nchoo nkatitin naapishana egiroo ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina dung'okinoto e nkiguana ene lelo arripok, embae natudung'oki to rorei le lelo sinyat, pee eyiolou ilooishu pooki nchere ore ilo otii shumata aisul ninye oitore enkitoria oo ltung'ana, neisho ninye ilo oyieu, nepik shumata ninye ilo oshal.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ena kidetidet, nanu olaiguanani Nebukadnesa, otadua. Naa ore iyie Belteshasa, mbalunye enkibalakinoto, enkaraki ore lelo tung'ana pooki ang'eni le nkitoria ai maaidim aaitayiolo nanu enkibalakinoto, kake indim iyie, amu etii enkiyang'et oo nkaitin sinyat atua iyie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etolimuo Daniel empukunoto e nkidetidet",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Daniel, apa oji enkarna enye Belteshesa, aing'asia te nkiti rishata neitanyamal ndamunot enyena ninye. Nejo olaiguanani, “Belteshesa, mincho kintanyamal ina kidetidet aashu enkibalakinoto.” Newalu Belteshasa ajo, “Olkitok lai, metaa ina kidetidet ene lelo likimba iyie ore enkibalakinoto enye neaku enoo lmang'ati linono! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo shani litodua iyie, otubulua negolu, o metabaiki enchumata enye keper, naa dapash ninye abaiki enkop pooki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laa eisidan mbenek enyena naa kumok ilng'anayio lenyena, naa ninye etii endaa e pooki toki; naa abori ninye etumie ng'uesi e ong'ata oloip, naa ilng'osil lenyena emanya ntaritik o loing'ang'e ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyie, ilo laaiguanani, itubula nigolu. Etubulua enkitoo ino o metabaiki shumata ore enkitoria ino netabaikia lubot e nkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina natoduaa olaiguanani olarriponi, ilo sinyati, edou eing'uaa shumata ejo, ‘Entudung entuuroi olchani ninyalinyala ninye, kake entung'uai enkobei o ntona enyena te nkop, eena te sekenkei o to suyai, too nkujit naanana e ong'ata; naa nchoo erubata enye eaku te nebo ng'uesi e ong'ata, o metaba anaa negiroo ninye nkatitin naapishana;’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ena ninye enkibalakinoto enye, laaiguanani: Enkitanapata e ilo otii shumata aisul, ninye shumata olkitok lai olaiguanani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nchere eikipuoi aaraa iyie aaitung'uaa iltung'ana, ore emanyisho ino naa keaku te nebo ing'uesi e ong'ata; eikinchori iyie inosa nkujit anaa olkiteng, naa eishalu iyie te nkoileelio e shumata, naa eikigiroo iyie nkatitin naapishana o metaba anaa niyiolounchere ilo otii shumata aisul oitore enkitoo e tung'ana, neisho ninye ilo oyieu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore anaa enaitanapishoteki pee eing'uari enkobei o ntona e ilo shani, naa kelo enkitoria ino adedeyu obaiki ina kata niyiolounye nchere keper naitoreisho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
